{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>&quot;Nobody know the cold of the winter, until they touch the frozen ice&quot;</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the new DLC for Cursed Mansion, will bring you to the cold of the winter inside of the mansion with the new &quot;Santa Outfit&quot; to explore the mystery who lurk within. Will it bring any luck? or will it invite any unwanted destiny? Let your instinct guide your curiosity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>DLC Game Walkthrough:</i></strong><br>1. After purchasing a DLC costume, you can now gain access to several special mirrors scattered inside the mansion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. When you go inside one, you will find treasure chest with the costume inside it for you to claim</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. After you claimed one, open the inventory to equip any costume you want to use throughout your journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. You have now wore the costume and ready to explore\u00a0the\u00a0mansion! <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696880/extras/guide_DLC_slide_2-min.png?t=1739860005\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696880/extras/guide_DLC_slide_3-min.png?t=1739860005\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696880/extras/guide_DLC_slide_4-min.png?t=1739860005\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696880/extras/guide_DLC_slide_5-min.png?t=1739860005\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;See you in the Mansion, Kind Spirit&quot;</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2696880?t=1739860005","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2696880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t